        'The thirty-fifth member surfaced on r7234 (60), whose first run took a red gate from it, and 60 measured the '
        'general exposure rather than reporting the one instance: every quote-pin whose clause spans a line wrap is a '
        'false negative waiting. Both detector repairs are ordered to 70 at r7223, together with a re-measurement of '
