        'ORDER TWO IS NOT DELIVERED AT r7175 AND WHAT IT RETURNED IS BETTER THAN THE COUNT IT WENT FOR: the floor is '
        'not a counting fact about the transverse-traceless condition, because that condition is solvable at every '
        'degree on this S3. 60 extended r7166s left-invariant frame machinery to symmetric two-tensors and, with the '
        'tool validated against the round spheres six Killing vectors, found the transverse-traceless space non-empty '
