        'ORDER TWO IS ANSWERED POSITIVE AT r7177 ON 60s r7190, AND THE FLOOR IS DERIVED ON THE CONSTRUCTIONS OWN S3 '
        'RATHER THAN BORROWED: the transverse-traceless rough Laplacian has spectrum L(L+2) - 2 exactly, returning 6, '
