        'THE STRETCH DATUM IS SETTLED AT r7179 ON cc66s r7177+cc66.142, AND THE ONE RESULT IT COULD HAVE MOVED WAS '
        'ALREADY PROVED IMMUNE. ACOUSTIC_two_arm imported at six configurations with its own module-level D_M read off: '
