        'r6903 (66) WORKS FIVE MORE. (2) The fixed-point claim is sharper than reported and the correction is a '
        'BRANCH and not a half-plane: on the circle w = pi/3 - w gives two fixed angles, pi/6 and 7pi/6, the '
