        'AND AT r6931+70.3 THE DEBT IS ZERO AND THE RATCHET BINDS: 857 pass, 0 fail, 1 over timeout, 2380 s, '
        'over all 858 registered and banked in RUN_RESULT.txt, with check_receipts_run reading it as covering '
