        'an idle machine; and the cost is LOCATED rather than asserted, cProfile putting 968 of the 1021 s in '
        'ten SEQUENTIAL subprocess runs of the photon hierarchy at about 97 s each, 51 s in CAMB, everything '
        'else under 2 s. r6959 DECLARES IT RATHER THAN LEAVING IT RED, with the other remedy declined and its '
        'reason given: the ten runs are independent so running them concurrently would work, and it would '
        'make one receipts internal parallelism fight the runners --jobs N so the suites total concurrency '
        'stops being what the flag says and the wall-clock the runner offers stops holding -- a declared '
