        'reader. Declared at 1800 s on the rule the existing declarations were set by, the measured figure '
        'times the measured contention spread of 1.7 rounded up, with the CI jobs own clock raised from 45 to '
        '75 minutes because the worst case is 2380 + 1200 ~ 3580 s and a job that fails on the clock rather '
        'than on the tree is the same defect as a cap that files a receipt as a failure. DISCHARGE NOW: ONE '
        'SUITE RUN SHOWING 858 PASS, 0 FAIL, 0 OVER TIMEOUT. The debt is zero and the declaration is made; '
